<<PlayBackgroundMusic Light_3>>
<<SetBGSprite TeaStall>>

// Day 6 - Final conversation and apprenticeship offer
With two successful days of tea service work behind him, Raju approaches Vikram about making their collaboration more formal and discussing what this experience has taught him about food service, community connection, and traditional hospitality.

The tea stall atmosphere reflects the comfortable working relationship that has developed between Raju and Vikram over days of collaboration. Today's conversation carries weight beyond immediate food service concerns as both prepare to discuss broader implications of their successful partnership and what it means for preserving traditional hospitality knowledge.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Vikram" "Excited">>
Vikram: Beta, I must admit - when you first expressed interest in tea preparation, I assumed it was typical modern curiosity that would fade.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Vikram" "Proud">>
Vikram: But these past few days have revealed something remarkable about your respect for traditional food service and quality preparation.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Thank you, uncle! Working here has been incredibly meaningful.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Serious">>
Raju: I've learned so much about traditional techniques, but also about hospitality, precision, and the importance of food service in creating community connections.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Vikram" "Smiling">>
Vikram: You've demonstrated that appreciation for food service isn't determined by family background - it's determined by character and genuine respect.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Vikram" "Proud">>
Vikram: Your help has not only made my work more manageable, but it's given me hope that these skills will maintain their value.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Serious">>
Raju: This experience has taught me that tea preparation embodies the same principles as any form of excellence.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Confident">>
Raju: Dedication, attention to detail, and genuine care for creating experiences that bring comfort and connection to people's daily lives.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Whether someone is mastering food service or pursuing cricket, success requires the same fundamental respect for quality and patient skill development.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Vikram" "Smiling">>
Vikram: Exactly, beta! And you've shown that young people can contribute meaningfully to preserving traditional food service.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Vikram" "Proud">>
Vikram: When they approach hospitality work with genuine reverence and willingness to learn proper methods.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Vikram" "Overjoyed">>
Vikram: I want to offer you ongoing tea preparation training - regular sessions where you can continue learning traditional techniques.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Vikram" "Excited">>
Vikram: While helping me with service work. You've earned the right to be considered a legitimate apprentice in hospitality, not just an interested observer.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Overjoyed">>
Raju: That's incredibly generous, uncle!

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Proud">>
Raju: But more than the training, I value what I've learned about the importance of food service and the dignity that comes from providing hospitality that connects people.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Vikram" "Smiling">>
Vikram: Then we both benefit perfectly - you gain traditional hospitality knowledge that will serve you well in any future endeavor.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Vikram" "Proud">>
Vikram: And I gain confidence that these skills will continue to receive the respect and appreciation they deserve from the next generation.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Proud">>
Raju: I'm honored to be your apprentice, uncle. Thank you for sharing your knowledge and showing me the true value of traditional craftsmanship.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Vikram" "Overjoyed">>
Vikram: Welcome to the tradition, beta. Together we'll keep these skills alive and respected!

<<HideAllCharacters>>
As their conversation concludes with establishment of an ongoing apprenticeship benefiting both participants while serving the broader goal of preserving traditional food service skills, Raju and Vikram understand they have created something more valuable than temporary assistance. They have demonstrated how mutual respect, dedicated effort, and shared commitment to excellence can bridge generational and social gaps to create partnerships that strengthen both individuals and traditional hospitality knowledge systems.

<<set $Vikram_Complete = true>>
<<jump Courage>>
